MTS Fortran translation
=======================

This project is a modern Fortran translation of the computational portions of
MTS 1.2.1 by Ruey S. Tsay, David Wood, Jon Lachmann, and contributors.
The original package is distributed under the Artistic License 2.0. The same
license is retained for this translation. See LICENSE and original/MTS-1.2.1.

Plotting, R S3/list presentation infrastructure, interactive console output,
R data objects, and Rcpp registration glue are not part of the Fortran API.
The attached fGarch, fBasics, and mvtnorm translations were inspected for
project layout and numerical conventions. Their GPL-licensed source is not
copied or linked into this Artistic-2.0 project; required probability and
linear-algebra kernels are implemented locally.
